## Stack

- Next.js 16 App Router (`src/app/`), React 19, TypeScript 5
- Zustand (store en `src/features/todos/store/`)
- `@base-ui/react` para Dialog, Field, Input, Select, Checkbox
- Tailwind CSS 4 + `DESIGN.md`
- Vitest + Testing Library (TDD obligatorio)

## Feature layout

- Dominio: `src/features/todos/` (components, store, lib, types, testing)
- Ruta: `src/app/page.tsx` compone `TodoPage`
- Persistencia: `localStorage` clave `todos:v1`

